  "bodyHash": "GLRI0nXd7UY=",
  "content": "<p>🛡️<span style=\"color:#000\"> <span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>3D 戰術裝甲模組</strong></span></span><br>一款技術性模組，新增了一系列真實的3D軍用裝甲，每件裝甲都有多樣化設計，展現其防護等級與戰術用途。</p><p>🎖️ 裝甲等級與視覺風格<br>🔹 輕型裝甲：</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1513841/description_bdaedd95-6b15-4fee-a588-585cca1f7872.png\" width=\"70\" height=\"81\"></p><p>採用纖薄流線型設計，覆蓋胸部區域，強調高機動性與速度。</p><p>防護：可抵擋手槍與衝鋒槍子彈。</p><p>變體：所有視覺風格皆有提供，包括Apple與AK-74圖示。</p><p>🔸 中型裝甲</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1513841/description_877ae208-0625-4014-84f3-428c2a929017.png\" width=\"83\" height=\"87\"></p><p>較為厚重的設計，前後配有可見的防彈板。</p><p>防護：可抵擋中間型步槍與精確射手步槍。</p><p>變體：所有視覺風格皆有提供，包括骷髏頭與Temu標誌。</p><p>🛑 重型裝甲：</p><p><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1513841/description_b851b149-8b79-4d2d-aa26-f881d2dd8995.png\" width=\"87\" height=\"98\"></p><p>大型寬闊的軍用背心，提供全身防護，並有厚實的強化層。</p><p>防護：可抵擋重型、中型與輕型武器。</p><p>變體：所有視覺風格皆有提供。</p><p>🎨 視覺自訂化<br>模組包含多種不同的視覺風格，適用於所有裝甲類型（輕型、中型和重型）：</p><p><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1513841/description_25b45b12-5feb-42f3-ba4a-524d1862f662.png\" width=\"69\" height=\"77\"><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1513841/description_2d0f6ed9-b643-4370-a5e0-ca07f6e3a146.png\" width=\"72\" height=\"80\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1513841/description_8b4ce358-42ce-45e2-ac8b-45390e08e49b.png\" width=\"71\" height=\"78\"><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1513841/description_44345b79-df9c-4e28-98dd-9903c9471679.png\" width=\"70\" height=\"79\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1513841/description_dd7316ea-00a5-4689-ba25-bf8f3c746798.png\" width=\"72\" height=\"80\"><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1513841/description_b13add0a-d428-456f-84e3-5c54f8e6dd45.png\" width=\"68\" height=\"79\"></p><p>骷髏頭與迷你AK-74：專業軍事風格的戰術設計。</p><p>Apple與Temu標誌：作為趣味元素加入，這些裝甲與其他裝甲擁有完全相同的防護數據。</p><p>頭盔：現代軍用頭盔設計目前正在開發中</p><p><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1513841/description_f259e632-94b0-477c-8066-ea32e56ec1c1.png\" width=\"65\" height=\"46\"><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1513841/description_bf258266-1478-4ab4-a984-1ec80081416b.png\" width=\"65\" height=\"45\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1513841/description_c114c218-b92e-4286-bbba-10e62353d026.png\" width=\"65\" height=\"46\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1513841/description_232dbb83-ea42-420d-82bb-d76e1237a9c2.png\" width=\"68\" height=\"53\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1513841/description_03f0ca2a-5818-491a-ad0c-d33c73f7e4ff.png\" width=\"76\" height=\"53\"></p>",
